---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" lang="en">
  <section class="page-shell">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="h1">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="intro">ORDO treats “verifiable facts” as the boundary—rather than monitoring people. This policy explains the minimal information we may process when you use this site, contact Support, or discuss orders.</p>
      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="prose">
          <h2 class="h2">1. What we don’t do</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>No ad profiling. We don’t sell personal data.</li>
            <li>No cross-site tracking. No default collection for scoring/ranking/behavioral intervention.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="h2">2. Information we may collect</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Information you submit</strong>: when you contact us via forms or email, we receive what you provide (name, email, message) and any factual materials you choose to include (e.g., screenshots, order details).</li>
            <li><strong>Order communications</strong>: when you email <a href="mailto:orders@ordoinc.com">orders@ordoinc.com</a>, we process the minimum information needed to fulfill the order and related communications.</li>
            <li><strong>Basic logs</strong>: hosting/CDN providers may log requests (IP, user-agent, timestamps, paths) for security and debugging.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="h2">3. How we use it</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>To respond to support and after-sales requests, and to improve the accuracy of public information.</li>
            <li>To communicate about orders, delivery, and necessary reconciliation.</li>
            <li>To maintain site security, prevent abuse, and troubleshoot.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="h2">4. Sharing & processors</h2>
          <p>We only share information with service providers when necessary to operate the site, communications, or delivery (e.g., hosting/CDN, email, logistics). We do not sell personal data.</p>

          <h2 class="h2">5. Retention</h2>
          <p>We keep information only for the minimum period needed for the purposes above, then delete or anonymize where applicable.</p>

          <h2 class="h2">6. Your choices</h2>
          <p>You may request access, correction, or deletion of information you provided to us. Use the Support page and include enough verifiable details for us to locate the record.</p>

          <h2 class="h2">7. Updates</h2>
          <p>We will publish updates on this page. We prefer changes that remain checkable (what changed, what it affects, and how to verify).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
